  "description": "Welvet - LOOM Neural Network Framework for .NET. 12 layer types (Dense, LSTM, RNN, Conv2D, Conv1D, MHA, LayerNorm, RMSNorm, SwiGLU, Softmax, Embedding, Parallel), transformer/LLM inference with streaming, neural tweening, K-Means clustering, Pearson/Spearman correlation, network grafting, step-based forward pass, 7 LR schedulers, 3 optimizers (SGD/AdamW/RMSprop), ensemble features, and bit-for-bit model sharing with Python/TypeScript/Go. Multi-platform: Linux, Windows, macOS, Android, iOS.",
